      "description": "As a\n Shopper,\nI want\n to watch a product video within the image gallery on the PDP,\nso that\n I can see the product in motion before deciding to buy.\nA product may have one or more videos (e.g. studio, campaign, runway) surfaced within the image gallery as tiles. Video content is hosted on Vimeo. The Vimeo embed URL is stored against the product via a custom SFCC product attribute (to be defined in SFCC-26), allowing merchandisers to assign and update video content in BM without a code deployment.\nThe video tile appears within the gallery at a configurable position. Video can play inline within the gallery or expand to the lightbox overlay. Autoplay behaviour is configurable per video instance without a code deployment.\nNote: Vimeo as the video hosting platform is not yet 100% confirmed — see dependencies.\nDepends on SFCC-186 (PDP – Product Image Gallery) for the gallery tile rendering foundation, and SFCC-26 (Product Attributes) for the custom video URL attribute definition.",
