      "description": "As a \nSite Merchandiser, \nI want\n the global footer content managed in Contentful, \nso that\n I can configure footer navigation links, their destinations, copy, and legal text per storefront without requiring a developer deployment.\nThis story is a follow-up to SFCC-55 (Global Footer UI), which builds the footer shell and layout with placeholder content. This story covers the Contentful content model and integration so that all footer content is fully CMS-managed. Footer content includes navigation link columns (e.g. About, Contact, Help), legal and copyright text, region-specific links (e.g. Acknowledgement of Country for AU), and the bottom bar. Email sign-up integration (Omneo) is covered separately in SFCC-99/100.",
