      "description": "As a \nSite Merchandiser, \n\n\nI want \nthe promotional announcement banner content managed in Contentful, \n\n\nso that \nI can configure banner messages, CTAs, rotation timing, page visibility, and scheduling without requiring a developer deployment.\n\n\nThis story is a follow-up to SFCC-51 (Promotional Announcement Banner UI), which builds the PWA component with mock content. This story covers the Contentful content model and the integration between Contentful and the PWA Kit component so that the banner is fully content-managed.\nComponent should handle the following flexibility, Site Merchandiser should be able to configure:\nconfigurable per storefront\nconfigurable per customer group\nconfigurable per logged in status\nconfigurable time of rotation (set time appropriately for the length of the message for accessibility standards)\nconfigurable pages\nconfigurable position\nconfigurable message\nconfigurable CTA\nconfigurable enablement on/off\nconfigurable content - content scheduling (start/end time)",
