      "id": "17881",
      "key": "SFCC-45",
      "summary": "Currency Conversion Approach Configuration",
      "description": "As a \nSite Admin or Site Merchandiser, \n\n\nI want\n to configure and manage currency conversion approaches, price coefficients, and rounding rules per market in SFCC Business Manager, \n\n\nso that\n prices displayed to shoppers in non-base currencies are calculated consistently and correctly per market.\nConversion approaches: \nBase RRP\nFixed Pricelist based on price coming from AP21\nFixed FX Rate\nDynamic FX Rate based on the nightly pricing job coming from Global-e\nPrice coefficients: \nEach market can have a configurable price coefficient — a multiplier applied on top of the FX conversion to account for local market positioning (e.g. a 1.05 coefficient adds a 5% uplift to the converted price for a specific market). \n\n\n\n\nRounding rules\n: Each currency has configurable rounding rules applied after conversion and coefficient calculation(e.g. round to nearest whole AED, round to 2 decimal places EUR, round to 0 decimal places JPY). \n\n",
